# PART 2 — WHAT MAKES IT LOOK "1000x PRO" (the 6 layers most themes skip)

## Layer 1 — SEO / Structured Data (`snippets/seo-schema.liquid`)
Every pro store emits JSON-LD:
- `Organization` + `WebSite` (with `SearchAction`) — on every page
- `Product` (with `offers`, `aggregateRating`, `review`) — on PDP
- `BreadcrumbList` — on PDP + collection
- `FAQPage` — on FAQ section
- `Article` — on blog posts
- `ItemList` — on collection pages

Plus `meta-tags.liquid`: og:title/image/type, twitter:card, canonical, `hreflang` if multi-locale.

**This alone puts you above 90% of Shopify themes.**

## Layer 2 — Motion (`assets/motion.js`)
Currently ZERO in our components. This is the biggest visual gap.
- Scroll reveal (IntersectionObserver, fade + translateY 20px, stagger children)
- Hover: card lift (translateY -4px + shadow), image scale 1.05
- Image zoom on PDP gallery
- Smooth drawer/accordion transitions (CSS transforms, not height)
- Page transition fade
- `prefers-reduced-motion` respected

**~3KB of JS. Transforms the entire feel.**

## Layer 3 — Typography system
Not just "a font" — a **scale**:
```css
--font-display: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 5rem);
--font-h1: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.5rem);
--font-h2: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
--font-body: 1rem;
--font-small: 0.875rem;
--tracking-tight: -0.02em;
--tracking-wide: 0.15em;   /* uppercase eyebrows */
--leading-tight: 1.1;      /* display */
--leading-body: 1.6;
```
Plus **font preload** in `theme.liquid` head — otherwise FOUT kills the premium feel.

## Layer 4 — Image discipline (CLS = 0)
- Every image has explicit `width`/`height` or `aspect-ratio`
- `srcset` with 5 breakpoints
- `loading="lazy"` below fold, `eager` + `fetchpriority="high"` on hero
- Blur-up or skeleton placeholder
- Hover second-image on product cards

## Layer 5 — Speed (this IS half of "premium")
- Critical CSS inlined in `<head>`
- All JS `defer`
- `preconnect` to cdn.shopify.com + fonts.gstatic.com
- Sections below fold lazy-rendered
- **Target: LCP < 2s on 4G mobile**

## Layer 6 — Micro-copy
- "Only 6 left" not "Low stock"
- "Delivered by Tuesday, 15 Jul" not "5-8 business days"
- "₹499 away from free shipping" not "Spend more for free shipping"
- AI generates these per store.

