# PART 3 — THE VARIETY ENGINE (how every store is different AND pro)

**You do NOT need unlimited components. You need combinatorics.**

## The math
```
Homepage has ~10 section slots.
Each slot has ~5 valid candidate components (one per design direction).

5^10 = 9,765,625 distinct homepage layouts

× section ORDER permutations (DNA-driven)
× token palettes (extracted per merchant — infinite)
× typography pairings (30 curated pairs)
× AI-generated content (unique per catalog)

= EFFECTIVELY INFINITE distinct stores
```

**225 components → crores of distinct pro stores.** That's the answer.

## The 5 variety dimensions

### 1. Design Direction (chosen from Store DNA)
LUXURY / MINIMAL / BOLD / EDITORIAL / PLAYFUL — each is a full token set + component variant family.

### 2. Token palette (extracted per merchant)
Colors from Claude Vision. Infinite by definition.

### 3. Typography pairing (curated pool — 30 pairs)
| Direction | Pairings |
|---|---|
| LUXURY | Playfair Display + Inter · Cormorant Garamond + Jost · Bodoni Moda + Karla · Libre Baskerville + Source Sans |
| MINIMAL | Inter + Inter · Satoshi + Satoshi · DM Sans + DM Sans · Manrope + Manrope |
| BOLD | Archivo Black + Inter · Anton + Roboto · Bebas Neue + Open Sans · Oswald + Lato |
| EDITORIAL | Fraunces + Inter · Lora + Nunito Sans · Crimson Pro + IBM Plex Sans · Spectral + Work Sans |
| PLAYFUL | Poppins + Poppins · Quicksand + Nunito · Baloo 2 + Mulish · Fredoka + Rubik |

### 4. Section order recipes (DNA-driven, not random)
```
CATALOG SMALL (<20 products), HIGH PRICE  → hero → brand-story → craftsmanship → 
   featured-few → testimonials → press → newsletter
   (storytelling-heavy, few products, trust-first)

CATALOG LARGE (>200), LOW-MID PRICE → hero → usp-bar → categories → bestsellers → 
   deals → new-arrivals → reviews → newsletter
   (discovery-heavy, browse-first)

NEW STORE (<10 reviews) → hero → usp-bar → featured → brand-story → founder-note → 
   guarantee → faq → newsletter
   (compensate for missing social proof with trust + story)

ESTABLISHED (>500 reviews) → hero → reviews-aggregate → bestsellers → ugc → 
   press → categories → newsletter
   (lead with social proof)
```

### 5. Layout density + motion preset
Airy / Standard / Tight × Subtle / Standard / Dynamic motion.

