# THE PRINCIPLE

> **A pro store is not one with more sections. It is one where every section is token-driven, motion-aware, CLS-free, schema-rich, and fast — and where the ORDER of sections was chosen for that specific catalog.**

Build 225 excellent components. Let combinatorics create the infinity.
